    },
    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U02-L26-ACTIVITY-011",
      "SourceSection": "26.3: Back to Funding the Future",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Let’s say you open a savings account with an interest rate of 5% per year compounded annually and that you plan on contributing the same amount to it at the start of every year.",
