    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U02-L26-ACTIVITY-014",
      "SourceSection": "26.3: Back to Funding the Future",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Say you decide to invest $1,000 into the account at the start of each year at the same interest rate. How many years until the account reaches $100,000? How does the amount you invest into the account compare to the amount of interest…",
